From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000084 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rob Vogelaar <rob.vogelaar@libertyglobal.com>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 17:15:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] cli: update client signal arcs without relayout

Represent client signal with five compact semicircular levels instead of a
circle surrounding each STA or IoT icon.  More importantly, update those arcs
in the existing SVG when the two-second client-metrics poll changes.  Metrics
are telemetry, not topology: rebuilding the complete D3 graph for each RSSI
change replaced the optimized force layout and caused the visible two-second
viewport jump.

Topology association or infrastructure changes still take the normal full
render path, preserving live steering and onboarding behavior.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [HWSIM evaluation WebUI]
---
 src/rdkb-cli/static/index.html |  2 +-
 src/rdkb-cli/static/script.js  | 69 +++++++++++++++++++++++++---------
 2 files changed, 52 insertions(+), 19 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/rdkb-cli/static/index.html b/src/rdkb-cli/static/index.html
index 6a4a73c..78026b2 100644
--- a/src/rdkb-cli/static/index.html
+++ b/src/rdkb-cli/static/index.html
@@ -2037,7 +2037,7 @@
     <div id="toast-container" class="toast-container"></div>

